      "writtenOn": "2024-02-13T17:21:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I re-added the plumbing, but made it set a runtime environment variable (`ANDROID_GFXSTREAM_CAPTURE_VK_SNAPSHOT`).  The reason is because rutabaga FFI doesn\u0027t support use flags right now and we want to transition testing layer to that, and it\u0027ll be have to be added.  But I think we\u0027ll likely can wait until a real VMM starts using the VK snapshots, and just use environment variables for now.",
      "parentUuid": "bf1706d3_ab6bc331",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 20,
        "startChar": 6,
        "endLine": 21,
        "endChar": 66
      },
      "revId": "9bca6e42d7c4090d196ad89900ea9348ac62aaa7",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
