      "writtenOn": "2024-02-13T00:31:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Optional: I wonder if it makes sense to implement this more like `FrameBuffer::blockPostWorker()` which actually stops the queue from processing. This would help prevent any kind of weird queue\u0027ing interaction where a test might accidentally still be doing/finishing work while the snapshot has started. WDYT?",
