      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-13T17:21:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If the queue consumer is single-threaded, wouldn\u0027t processing be serialized (like the `virtio_gpu` thread in crosvm)?",
      "parentUuid": "6ca867a2_25ce5b49",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 165,
        "startChar": 4,
